      en: ["Ismayilli State Reserve was formally established in 1981.", "The total land area of the reserve is 16,740 hectares.", "The elevation within the reserve ranges from 600 to 2,250 meters.", "Over 40 species of mammals are native to this protected area.", "The Caucasian beech is the most prevalent tree species in its forests.", "The reserve is divided into two distinct sectors: Topchu and Galadjik."],
